      "reason": "Eryone's Hyper Speed Dual Color Silk PLA publishes a glass transition of 57 ℃ and a Vicat softening point of 56 ℃ (ASTM D1525 ISO 306 GB/T 1633). A Vicat measured under the heavier load sits below the lighter one's and can sit below the glass transition; the pair is what the two methods give on one material, and both are recorded as printed.",
